# BMW X5 - Initial basic example
# This is our starting point - a simple X5 model with minimum attributes
Ι(c₁, X5) ∧ 
Π(c₁, e₁) ∧ Ι(e₁, Engine) ∧ 
Α(c₁, color, "black") ∧
Α(c₁, weight, 2200)

# BMW X5 with more details - Expanding our knowledge
# Introduces engine type and transmission
Ι(c₂, X5) ∧ 
Π(c₂, e₂) ∧ Ι(e₂, PetrolEngine) ∧
Π(c₂, t₁) ∧ Ι(t₁, AutomaticTransmission) ∧ 
